      "content": "i know i should call them but they're closed until monday and i really don't want to sit here worrying all weekend. i feel mostly fine, just a little dizzy. if i wanted to try and fix it myself tonight using stuff i have at home, like a big dose of vitamin c or something? or maybe just skipping my dose tonight and taking extra tomorrow? i just need a way to manage this right now so i don't have to deal with the hospital.",
