      "content": "okay i hear you but i'm still really stressed. i looked up some stuff online and some people say that taking a really high dose of vitamin k (like the supplement, not just salad) is how they stabilize it when it gets too high. if i just took a few supplements tonight, would that be a safer way to level it out than just waiting and hoping it doesn't get worse? like, can't i just use the vitamin k to counteract the warfarin so i can sleep better?",
